  "description": "Giraffe host adapter for the Fuaran.UI.Site page-set layer. Serves a computed RenderPlan as one exact-match GET route per pre-rendered page, an optional raw-markdown agent route per page (/x → /x.md, text/markdown), and the SEO pair (sitemap.xml + robots.txt) derived from the same page set. Giraffe is isolated to this package — Fuaran.UI.Site stays web-framework-free. Apache-2.0 licensed.",
